 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tires",
   "text": "I observed that the tires were matched by brand and had an appropriate tire tread. However, All four hub caps are showing miscellaneous curb rash on each tire more evident on corners/edges."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "There are minor miscellaneous scratches around the vehicle, normal for its mileage, and most are too small to see in photos. The exterior of the vehicle was slightly dusty at time of inspection. This can hide minor imperfections. I noticed dent on the rear left fender. Also, the rear bumper shows dent. Refer to photo #87. The underside shows areas of surface rust. See pictures. I also noticed portions of rust on the engine bay. I noticed some scratches and stone chips on the front bumper. Also, the rear bumper shows scratches and damage. Refer to photo #91. I found some scrapes on the lower part of front bumper. Refer to photo #85."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "Upon inspection, no unusual odors were noted inside the vehicle. The control buttons, audio system, navigation system, and climate control functioned properly. All seat belts buckled and unbuckled properly. However, I observed that the steering wheel shows wear. There is light wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. I noticed minor stains on the seats. I observed some scuffed marks on the inner door panels. The interior trim of the vehicle shows wear. I noticed stains on the bed of cargo area. The center console shows wear. The carpet shows normal wear and dirty. The floor mats are dirty."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "The engine oil is dirty and should be changed. Surface rust can be found on some portions of the exhaust pipe, welds, and flanges which is a typical occurrence. Only one key fob was shown during inspection. I noted full accessible fluids and did not have any visible or active fluid leaks at the time of inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "I found no issues during the test drive. The engine had plenty of power with no misfires. The transmission function as designed, with no harsh engagement or slipping. The steering was responsive, the suspension was firm, and the vehicle handled well. I hooked up my Scan Tool to the computer system and found no current or pending codes. All of the live data looked good, with no reported issues."
  }
 ],
